[1.1.37] - 2026-02-28
--------------------
Initial release with the following features:

Core Features:
- Markdown file rendering with syntax highlighting
- Directory tree navigation
- File search functionality
- URL path persistence
- Dark/Light theme toggle

Authentication:
- JWT-based login system
- Token persistence (30 days)
- Logout confirmation dialog

Directory Management:
- UI-based directory configuration
- Add/remove directories via modal
- Directory expand state memory
- Expand/collapse all button
- Show/hide empty directories toggle

File Support:
- .md files with Markdown rendering
- .txt files with plain text display
- .json files with formatted display
- Image support with relative path resolution

Navigation:
- Internal link navigation between documents
- Auto-expand tree and highlight current file
- Sidebar width adjustment (drag to resize)
- Copy path button on hover

UI/UX:
- Notion-style clean interface
- Responsive design
- TOC (Table of Contents) panel
- Keyboard shortcuts
- Toast notifications

Bug Fixes:
- Clipboard API compatibility
- Path simplification (~ instead of absolute home directory paths)
- Header height consistency
- Cache refresh handling
